SetUp Apache WebServer on Linux
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
launch Amazon linux 2,t2.micro,Ec2 instance
connect to the VM and execute below commands;
sudo yum install httpd -y
cat /etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf #all apache configurations will be here (Changing port,listen 80or 8080). scroll down to "listen 80".if you want 
you can change the port so that httpd will work on custom port as well .but don't do that
cd /var/www/html/
vi index.html
<Write some content>

systemctl status httpd
sudo systemctl start httpd
open port 80 and access the app

